#!/usr/bin/env python3
# apply_vet_panel_v2.py — VET_V1 ("Velvet") dashboard brought to fleet grade.
#
# Fence: VET_PANEL_V2_20260921
# Builds on: the VET_V1 integration as committed on main (asserted below:
#   vet_state_routes.py carries /status + /trades and NO earlier panel fence;
#   VETPanel.jsx is the v1 "TMA2Panel conventions, 2026-08-29" file).
#
# WHY (2026-09-21 screenshots): Trades page showed the carried SHORT
# NIFTY2692223400PE at +Rs35,588 while the VET dashboard showed only
# "SHORT <symbol> @ 144.6" on a bare background.
#   1. v1 never had the data: /api/vet/status returns symbol + entry price
#      only — no qty, entry time, expiry, mark — and the panel ignored the
#      ltpMap prop StrategyHost already passes.
#   2. v1 cards read tokens that do not exist (colors.bgAlt; colors.border
#      used as a string -> "1px solid [object Object]"), so every card lost
#      its surface and border.
#   3. VET's tick engine (TMA2TickEngine) keeps its own chain store and does
#      NOT publish to LTPStore. The Trades page only had an LTP because
#      another strategy happened to subscribe that strike. The new route
#      therefore supplies its own mark, with an honest source label.
#   4. The position lived only in the manager: while the loop waits for the
#      Zerodha session / warmup, a carried positional row was invisible.
#
# WHAT THIS DOES
#   EDIT backend/app/api/vet_state_routes.py (append-only, both trees):
#        GET /api/vet/state — composed payload: mode/config, engine health,
#        regime (admin only, stripped server-side), position with mark +
#        mark_src (LTP fresh <=90s | QUOTE_1M | LTP_STALE), wing, carried
#        flag, DB fallback when the loop is not up, closed groups (today by
#        EXIT timestamp, IST) + today_net. /status and /trades byte-identical.
#   NEW  backend/app/api/test_vet_state_route.py (both trees) — 31 checks on
#        the REAL epoch clock; no TestClient.
#   NEW  frontend/src/strategies/vet/VETPanel.jsx v2 (v1 backed up).
#   Engine, manager, selection loop, tick engine: NOT touched.
#
# The script runs the behavioural suite after writing and ROLLS BACK every
# file if it fails. Files only — nothing restarts. TSG is live: rebuild and
# restart AFTER 15:30 IST.
#
# USAGE: python3 apply_vet_panel_v2.py --check && python3 apply_vet_panel_v2.py

from __future__ import annotations
import argparse, os, py_compile, shutil, subprocess, sys, tempfile
from datetime import datetime, timedelta, timezone

